| `/* l298n_ctrl.cpp … */` | Block comment – tells readers the whole file’s purpose. |
| `#include <iostream>` | Pulls in `std::cout` for printing status messages. |
| `#include <unistd.h>` | Provides `usleep()` (kept for future timers). |
| `#include <stdint.h>` | Defines `uint` type (used in function parameters). |
